#: ../../source/database/queries.rst:97
msgid "Protecting Identifiers"
msgstr "식별자 보호"

#: ../../source/database/queries.rst:100
msgid "$db->protectIdentifiers()"
msgstr "$db->protectIdentifiers()"

#: ../../source/database/queries.rst:102
msgid ""
"In many databases, it is advisable to protect table and field names - for "
"example with backticks in MySQL. **Query Builder queries are automatically "
