msgid "Upsert from a Query"
msgstr "쿼리에서 Upsert"

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:998
msgid "You can also upsert from a query:"
msgstr "쿼리에서 upsert할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:1002
msgid ""
"The ``setQueryAsData()``, ``onConstraint()``, and ``updateFields()`` methods"
" can be used since v4.3.0."
msgstr ""
"``setQueryAsData()``, ``onConstraint()``, ``updateFields()`` 메서드는 v4.3.0부터 "
"사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:1008
msgid "$builder->onConstraint()"
msgstr "$builder->onConstraint()"

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:1012
msgid ""
"Allows manually setting constraint to be used for upsert. This does not work"
