msgid "Compiles an ``INSERT`` statement and returns it as a string."
msgstr "``INSERT`` 문을 컴파일하여 문자열로 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:2091
msgid "Compiles an ``UPDATE`` statement and returns it as a string."
msgstr "``UPDATE`` 문을 컴파일하여 문자열로 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:2099
msgid "Compiles a ``DELETE`` statement and returns it as a string."
msgstr "``DELETE`` 문을 컴파일하여 문자열로 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/database/results.rst:5
